	skos:exactMatch dex:Example ;
	skos:inScheme dpv_linkml:dpv_terms ;
	skos:note "Every file leaves its prefixes out, so a parser reads it with the prefixes of the vocabularies beside it. An example may show two ways of saying one thing, so its resources are what the file states, not one consistent account." .
